## Cold forges

@narrator: Every forge in town is cold. Every one but the last.
@bram{emotion="happy"}: CUSTOMERS! Finally! Sit! Sharpen! Doris hasn't had a visitor in a month!
@aria: Why is your forge the only one burning?
@bram{emotion="sad"}: Because I don't let it go out. Not for a second. Not since the dark came.
